224	// item was born with. Read back rather than kept only for the agent to read,
225	// because an operator's PARAMETERS ride here: `create-work-item --context
226	// "REPOS=Alpha Beta"` is how a forced run says what it is running on, and the
227	// executor hands these lines to code-work as `CLAUDINITE_CONTEXT`.
228	//
